# Copy to .env. dev.sh needs WEBUI_SECRET_KEY set — unlike start.sh, it does
# not generate one for you.
#
# DEV ONLY. Fixed and identical for everyone who clones this repo, on
# purpose: it exists only to sign local session tokens on a machine with no
# real users and no PRs landing on it, and Extra's extra/.env must hold this
# exact same value as AGENT_AUTH_SECRET (HMAC — both sides sign and verify
# with one shared secret). If you ever deploy this anywhere reachable by
# anyone but you, generate a real one instead:
#     openssl rand -base64 24
